{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54589","headline":"兵要望江南 占霞第六（京本列第二十六○十一首） 九 · 易静","name":"兵要望江南 占霞第六（京本列第二十六○十一首） 九","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"霞似虎（辛本作「似席」、京本作「与气」），云即便（京本作「变」）爲龙。\n龙虎相交军必战（川本、辛本作「胜」），临时胜负更看风（辛本、川本作「辨谁凶」），逐（辛本、川本作「遂」）我彼军凶。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"易静","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54589.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54589","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}